# Real scanned documents and generated output are NEVER committed.
# test.pdf/test.xlsx used during development contain genuine students'
# names, ID numbers, and grades (University of Rwanda transcripts) --
# this is personal academic data and must not reach a GitHub repo,
# public or private. If you need fixtures for tests, use synthetic
# data with fabricated names/numbers, not real scans.
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.xls
!fixtures/**/*.pdf
!fixtures/**/*.xlsx

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# Local SQLite database (Phase 1 completion: documents_converter/api/db.py) --
# the default DATABASE_URL points here for zero-config local/dev use.
# Never committed: it's runtime state (job records), not source, and a
# real deployment either mounts a volume for it or points DATABASE_URL
# at Postgres instead.
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local Claude Code session state, not project code
.claude/
